    "detailed_description": "SoLo is a third person shooter from 4886 Studios. Your story begins as your ship crash lands on the planet Minos III. Stranded and alone, your only hope is to team up with an eccentric alien scientist. Together you will battle against a militant group of interplanetary poachers who are searching for something deep beneath the planet's surface. Armed with a host of weapons, vehicles and alien tech, you can use stealth or go in guns blazing to bring these hunters down.<br />\r\nBut be careful, as beneath the surface of Minos III, you will discover something ancient and more dangerous than this alien militia.",
    "about_the_game": "SoLo is a third person shooter from 4886 Studios. Your story begins as your ship crash lands on the planet Minos III. Stranded and alone, your only hope is to team up with an eccentric alien scientist. Together you will battle against a militant group of interplanetary poachers who are searching for something deep beneath the planet's surface. Armed with a host of weapons, vehicles and alien tech, you can use stealth or go in guns blazing to bring these hunters down.<br />\r\nBut be careful, as beneath the surface of Minos III, you will discover something ancient and more dangerous than this alien militia.",
    "short_description": "SoLo is a Sci-Fi third person shooter set on a hostile desert planet. Recruited to fight alongside an alien studying the planet, you must battle with a race of interplanetary poachers that are plundering the wildlife and natural resources",
